ous feats of strength and skill will unlock achievements that could earn you a Sponsor. Sponsors provide unique gameplay modifiers that can do many things from changing the rules of the game to providing special abilities. Be careful, Sponsors aren't your friend, and some of their effects can be detrimental to your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/a5946d492e21dcd781768981919d88ea.avif?t=1772544866\" width=643 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At first, the horde will overwhelm you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the end of each round, you'll earn XP Points which will level up your character. When your character levels up, you gain skill points which can be used to increase your power in order to survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/81d0e3d223332bb351404e790657b6ba.poster.avif?t=1772544866\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/81d0e3d223332bb351404e790657b6ba.webm?t=1772544866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/81d0e3d223332bb351404e790657b6ba.mp4?t=1772544866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/c7284ad7460a13fc873624b018bb019d.avif?t=1772544866\" width=643 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You won't be finding any treasure chests just laying about in this game. Instead, you'll have to complete events that spawn around the stage. The events can be a bit risky to complete, but with high risk comes high reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/e7cf13d1855a0a27654fd25f3f5525f1.poster.avif?t=1772544866\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/e7cf13d1855a0a27654fd25f3f5525f1.webm?t=1772544866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/e7cf13d1855a0a27654fd25f3f5525f1.mp4?t=1772544866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/77f3ca4097f1cc33fa3111fed7a9aa12.avif?t=1772544866\" width=643 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Killing enemies fills your brutality gauge, which enables you to unleash powerful attacks that do massive damage to enemies. Each character has different brutal abilities.\u00a0<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/1944e496da7809418bb15bb20cf04b76.poster.avif?t=1772544866\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/1944e496da7809418bb15bb20cf04b76.webm?t=1772544866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/extras/1944e496da7809418bb15bb20cf04b76.mp4?t=1772544866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Overdraw Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378140/2cc841e9727341fba9e93d18f2b19584e5ee9625/header.jpg?t=1772544866","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3378140/1281013032/26ad6c5ab2473d1df6dd846246d828db963e862b/1757707746/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757709393","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3378140/1281013032/26ad6c5ab2473d1df6dd846246d828db963e862b/1757707746/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757709393","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3378140/1281013032/26ad6c5ab2473d1df6dd846246d828db963e862b/1757707746/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757709393","id":257082202,"name":"Demo Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257082202/159b7d751d81840cb9b01957d280f6a3c786c77d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757709393"}],"name":"Resistance Is Brutal","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD processor at 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any DirectX 11 or DirectX 12 Compatible Card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Overdraw Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":